Dragon scale isn't magical, only dragon scale mail, so you could have
wished for that.
In UnNethack, the shield of reflection is also not considered magical.
Failing that, there's always an oilskin sack.

I believe you can wish for anything with a wand wish, but potion,
fountain, throne and lamp wishes never allow magical items.

It does make random wishes less beneficial, but in my opinion that's a
good thing.  Would you have prefered not to get a wish at all from
your #dip?  If so, maybe Un should let you set an option to this
effect.

